  "description": "T1 (poplar) - fell to ground level and remove stump.\r\rThis tree is to be felled in order to facilitate the archaeological investigation, agreed under discharge of Condition 5 and subsequent implementation of Full Planning Permission 21/AP/1812.\r\rThe CAVAT value of this tree was agreed with the Council on the 24th of October 2024 as ?56,992 (fifty six thousand, nine hundred and ninety two pounds) with removal costs (account for highway management etc.) being in addition to this sum. This sum will be transferred to the Council prior to the removal of this tree, unless the inverse is subsequently agreed with the Council.\r\rThe Council have agreed (by the above date) that the transfer of the CAVAT sum will fund the planting and aftercare of new trees within the local area. No replacement tree planting will therefore occur as part of this application; Tree Preservation Order (No. 693) 2023 will therefore need to be revoked, as it will protect no remaining trees.",
